{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "df0f2fa1-fb3f-4387-a1cb-3564c251f8b9",
		"name": "ServeRest",
		"description": "**O ServeRest é uma API REST gratuita que simula uma loja virtual com intuito de servir de material de estudos de testes de API.**\n\n**Não deixe de seguir o [autor do projeto](https://github.com/PauloGoncalvesBH) e deixar um star no repositório: [github.com/ServeRest/ServeRest](https://github.com/ServeRest/ServeRest)**\n\nEssa página documenta todas as rotas e como acessá-las. Para mais detalhes do ServeRest (como executar localmente utilizando Docker ou NPM, alterar timeout de autenticação, etc) acesse [o repositório do ServeRest](https://github.com/serverest/serverest).\n\nEstá utilizando Postman? Importe o [JSON do Swagger](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServeRest/ServeRest/trunk/docs/swagger.json) para ter acesso às collections.\n\nVai fazer teste de carga? Leia a seção '[Teste de Carga](https://github.com/ServeRest/ServeRest#teste-de-carga)'.\n\n\nMuito obrigado ♥ a todos que apoiam o projeto [financeiramente](https://opencollective.com/serverest#section-contributors) ou [com código, ideias e divulgação](https://github.com/ServeRest/ServeRest#contribuidores-), graças a vocês **mais de R$ 2000,00 foram doados para a ONG [Todas as letras](https://todasasletras.org/)** até o momento.\n\nO ServeRest possui um front, com status em beta, não deixe de conhecer: [front.serverest.dev](https://front.serverest.dev).\n\nPrecisa de apoio? [Abra uma issue](https://github.com/ServeRest/ServeRest/issues) ou contate o mantenedor do projeto:\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Paulo Gonçalves",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "16086735",
		"_collection_link": "https://www.postman.com/lunar-equinox-221114/workspace/desafio-de-automao-de-testes-de-api/collection/16086735-df0f2fa1-fb3f-4387-a1cb-3564c251f8b9?action=share&source=collection_link&creator=16086735"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Caminho Feliz",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Login Válido",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.response.to.have.status(200);\r",
									"});\r",
									"\r",
									"let json;\r",
									"try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { json = {}; }\r",
									"\r",
									"pm.test(\"Response has authorization token\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.expect(json).to.have.property(\"authorization\");\r",
									"  pm.expect(json.authorization).to.be.a(\"string\").and.to.not.be.empty;\r",
									"});\r",
									"\r",
									"// Store token in environment exactly as returned (some responses include \"Bearer ...\")\r",
									"if (json && json.authorization) {\r",
									"  pm.environment.set(\"authToken\", json.authorization);\r",
									"}\r",
									""
								],
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"packages": {},
								"requests": {}
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\r\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\r\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\r\n}\r\n",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"login"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Criar usuário válido",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const email = `teste_${Date.now()}@qa.com`;\r",
									"pm.environment.set(\"testUserEmail\", email);\r",
									"pm.environment.set(\"testUserEmail2\", `dup_${Date.now()}@qa.com`);\r",
									""
								],
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"packages": {},
								"requests": {}
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status is 201 (created)\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.response.to.have.status(201);\r",
									"});\r",
									"\r",
									"let json = {};\r",
									"try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch(e) {}\r",
									"\r",
									"pm.test(\"Has success message\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.expect(json).to.have.property(\"message\");\r",
									"  pm.expect(json.message).to.be.a(\"string\").that.includes(\"Cadastro\");\r",
									"});\r",
									"\r",
									"// Save user id for next requests\r",
									"if (json && json._id) {\r",
									"  pm.environment.set(\"testUserId\", json._id);\r",
									"} else if (json && json._id === undefined && json.id) {\r",
									"  pm.environment.set(\"testUserId\", json.id);\r",
									"}\r",
									""
								],
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"packages": {},
								"requests": {}
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "{{authToken}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\r\n  \"nome\": \"Usuário Teste\",\r\n  \"email\": \"{{testUserEmail}}\",\r\n  \"password\": \"teste123\",\r\n  \"administrador\": \"true\"\r\n}\r\n",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"usuarios"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Listar todos os usuários",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": []
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "4. Buscar usuário por ID",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": []
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "5. Atualizar usuário",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status is 200 (or 201 if API creates new)\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.expect([200,201]).to.include(pm.response.code);\r",
									"});\r",
									"\r",
									"let json = {};\r",
									"try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch(e) {}\r",
									"\r",
									"pm.test(\"Has message about update\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.expect(json).to.have.property(\"message\");\r",
									"  // accept either \"Registro alterado com sucesso\" or similar\r",
									"  pm.expect(json.message.toLowerCase()).to.match(/alterad|sucesso|edit/i);\r",
									"});\r",
									""
								],
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"packages": {},
								"requests": {}
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.environment.get(\"authToken\")) {\r",
									"  pm.request.headers.add({ key: \"Authorization\", value: pm.environment.get(\"authToken\") });\r",
									"}\r",
									""
								],
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"packages": {},
								"requests": {}
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "{{authToken}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\r\n  \"nome\": \"Usuário Teste Atualizado\",\r\n  \"email\": \"nicolas.test@mailinator.com\",\r\n  \"password\": \"teste123\",\r\n  \"administrador\": \"true\"\r\n}\r\n",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{testUserId}}",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"usuarios",
								"{{testUserId}}"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "6. Excluir usuário",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": []
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Cenários negativos",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Criar usuário sem campo obrigatório",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Should return validation error status (e.g., 400)\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.expect([400,422]).to.include(pm.response.code);\r",
									"});\r",
									"\r",
									"let json = {};\r",
									"try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch(e) {}\r",
									"\r",
									"pm.test(\"Has error message about required fields\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.expect(json).to.have.property(\"message\");\r",
									"  pm.expect(json.message.toLowerCase()).to.satisfy(m => m.includes(\"password\") || m.includes(\"campo\") || m.includes(\"obrig\"));\r",
									"});\r",
									""
								],
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"packages": {},
								"requests": {}
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "{{authToken}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\r\n  \"nome\": \"Usuário Sem Senha\",\r\n  \"email\": \"no_password_{{ $randomInt }}@qa.com\",\r\n  \"administrador\": \"true\"\r\n}\r\n",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"usuarios"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Criar usuário com e-mail duplicado",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Expect duplicate email to be rejected (400)\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.expect([400,409]).to.include(pm.response.code); // 409 Conflict or 400 depending on API\r",
									"});\r",
									"\r",
									"let json = {};\r",
									"try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch(e) {}\r",
									"\r",
									"pm.test(\"Has duplicate message\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.expect(json).to.have.property(\"message\");\r",
									"  pm.expect(json.message.toLowerCase()).to.satisfy(m => m.includes(\"email\") && (m.includes(\"existe\") || m.includes(\"já\")));\r",
									"});\r",
									""
								],
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"packages": {},
								"requests": {}
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "{{authToken}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\r\n  \"nome\": \"Usuário Duplicado\",\r\n  \"email\": \"{{testUserEmail}}\",\r\n  \"password\": \"teste123\",\r\n  \"administrador\": \"false\"\r\n}\r\n",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"usuarios"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Acessar endpoint sem token",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": []
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "4. Acessar endpoint com token inválido",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": []
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "5. 5. Buscar usuário inexistente(id inválido)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": []
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "6.Atualizar usuário com e-mail de outro usuário (duplicidade)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Updating to duplicate email should be rejected\", () => {\r",
									"  pm.expect([400,409]).to.include(pm.response.code);\r",
									"});\r",
									"\r",
									"let json = {};\r",
									"try { json = pm.response.json(); } catch(e) {}\r",
									"\r",
									"pm.test(\"Has duplicate email message\", () => {\r",
									"  if (json && json.message) pm.expect(json.message.toLowerCase()).to.satisfy(m => m.includes(\"email\") && (m.includes(\"existe\") || m.includes(\"já\") || m.includes(\"duplicate\")));\r",
									"});\r",
									""
								],
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"packages": {},
								"requests": {}
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{testUserId}}",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"usuarios",
								"{{testUserId}}"
							]
						}
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		}
	],
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "//localhost:3000"
		}
	]
}